{
  "tema": 7026,
  "slug": "demasiado-bastante-pronombres",
  "titulo": "Mucho, poco, demasiado, bastante, suficiente, tanto as pronouns",
  "subtitulo": "¿Tortillas? Hay muchas. ¿Sillas? No hay suficientes.",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "Mucho, poco, demasiado, bastante, suficiente and tanto can stand alone, replacing a noun already mentioned. They agree with that noun: mucho, mucha, muchos, muchas; bastante and suficiente change only for number. Plural masculine on its own (muchos, pocos) can mean many / few people.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "When the noun is already clear, drop it and keep the quantity word: **¿Hay tortillas? —Sí, hay muchas.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The word **agrees** with the noun it replaces: **singular** for things you can't count (agua, tiempo), **plural** for things you can count (sillas, amigos)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "Masc. sing.",
            "Fem. sing.",
            "Masc. pl.",
            "Fem. pl."
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "_a lot, many_",
              "mucho",
              "mucha",
              "muchos",
              "muchas"
            ],
            [
              "_little, few_",
              "poco",
              "poca",
              "pocos",
              "pocas"
            ],
            [
              "_too much, too many_",
              "demasiado",
              "demasiada",
              "demasiados",
              "demasiadas"
            ],
            [
              "_so much, so many_",
              "tanto",
              "tanta",
              "tantos",
              "tantas"
            ],
            [
              "_quite a lot, enough_",
              "bastante",
              "bastante",
              "bastantes",
              "bastantes"
            ],
            [
              "_enough_",
              "suficiente",
              "suficiente",
              "suficientes",
              "suficientes"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Bastante** and **suficiente** have **no feminine form**: only **-s** for plural."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With no noun at all, **muchos, pocos, bastantes** = _many / few / quite a few people_: **Muchos piensan que…**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: the pronoun wears the noun's clothes. Tortillas → **muchas**; agua → **poca**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
